### Mesure valide : 202
POST http://localhost:8081/api/measurements
Content-Type: application/json

{"sensorId":"SENSOR-001","timestamp":"2026-11-06T08:15:00Z","powerKw":3.72,"voltage":226.4,"temperature":29.1}

### Mesure sans sensorId : 400
POST http://localhost:8081/api/measurements
Content-Type: application/json

{"timestamp":"2026-11-06T08:15:00Z","powerKw":3.72,"voltage":226.4}

### Puissance négative : 400
POST http://localhost:8081/api/measurements
Content-Type: application/json

{"sensorId":"SENSOR-001","timestamp":"2026-11-06T08:15:00Z","powerKw":-1,"voltage":226.4}

### Créer un capteur : 201
POST http://localhost:8083/api/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{"sensorId":"SENSOR-006","name":"Compteur cafétéria","building":"Bâtiment A","floor":1,"maxPowerKw":6.0,"active":true,"tags":["office"]}

### Lister les capteurs
GET http://localhost:8083/api/sensors

### Résumé quotidien (MongoDB)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/sensors/SENSOR-003/daily-summary

### Historique (Cassandra)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/measurements/SENSOR-003?from=2026-11-06T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-06T23:59:59Z

### Dernière mesure (cache Redis)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/measurements/SENSOR-003/latest

### Indicateurs
GET http://localhost:8083/api/analytics/SENSOR-003/summary

### Anomalies
GET http://localhost:8083/api/analytics/SENSOR-003/anomalies

### Prévision
GET http://localhost:8083/api/analytics/SENSOR-003/forecast?horizonMinutes=60
